es of the hyperbola?" 13194139534861 true] [17592186315643 1113 #uuid "b2f415cf-02db-5940-b8b7-a0327c22a852" 13194139534861 true] [17592186315643 1145 "To find the intersection of the hyperboloid and the plane $x=\\sqrt{2},$ we substitute $x=\\sqrt{2}$ into the equation of the hyperboloid:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(\\sqrt{2})^{2}-\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{3}+\\frac{(z+3)^{2}}{12} & =-1 \\\\ 2-\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{3}+\\frac{(z+3)^{2}}{12} & =-1 \\\\ -\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{3}+\\frac{(z+3)^{2}}{12} & =-3 \\\\ \\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{3}-\\frac{(z+3)^{2}}{12} & =3 \\\\ \\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{9}-\\frac{(z+3)^{2}}{36} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{{3}^{2}}-\\frac{(z+3)^{2}}{{6}^{2}} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us the equation of a hyperbola with semi-axes of lengths $3$ and $6.$" 13194139534861 true] [17592186315644 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315645 13194139534861 true] [17592186315644 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315646 13194139534861 true] [17592186315644 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315647 13194139534861 true] [17592186315644 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315648 13194139534861 true] [17592186315644 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315649 13194139534861 true] [17592186315644 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534861 true] [17592186315644 1041 "selection" 13194139534861 true] [17592186315644 1104 #edb/ref 17592186315649 13194139534861 true] [17592186315644 1110 #uuid "baf54bdd-3f28-5615-945b-95c8068938e8" 13194139534861 true] [17592186315645 1034 "$9$ and $36$" 13194139534861 true] [17592186315645 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534861 true] [17592186315645 1111 #uuid "1b3087b4-b009-5638-b244-ea98ae062981" 13194139534861 true] [17592186315646 1034 "$\\sqrt{3}$ and $2\\sqrt{3}$" 13194139534861 true] [17592186315646 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534861 true] [17592186315646 1111 #uuid "4d61123d-f51c-55c6-8d64-9c05a7741c38" 13194139534861 true] [17592186315647 1034 "$3$ and $12$" 13194139534861 true] [17592186315647 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534861 true] [17592186315647 1111 #uuid "3019cd0e-f7b8-53ef-a263-a5